{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PRESENTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ShiNingCloud Studio</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an ARPG game developped by UE5 and mainly features the  Sparring &amp; Suppression combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are not only\u00a0intense BOSS combats<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749654326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But also Hack&amp;Slash Minion wipes<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749654326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Suppression-OVERTAKE system will give you an unique interaction experience.(Similar to Sekiro's offset, but it's focused on attack instead of defense)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except super cool actions, this game also has a Diablo-like role development &amp; loot system.  Allocate your attributes, talents FREELY and BUILD your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Higher the difficulty, better the drops! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer your enemy\u00a0and  LOOT your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you find bugs or have any suggestion, feel free to contact me. You can send an email or leave me a message on bilibili.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Good Luck &amp; Have Fun!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686170?t=1749654326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/4bae883020f21b2940f3efb866f6190df0bcfc3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749654326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/1d55f5fa53680567928fb564c8aaff6fb33d6111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749654326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/1d55f5fa53680567928fb564c8aaff6fb33d6111/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749654326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3766970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PRESENTS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ShiNingCloud Studio</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an ARPG game developped by UE5 and mainly features the  Sparring &amp; Suppression combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are not only\u00a0intense BOSS combats<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749654326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But also Hack&amp;Slash Minion wipes<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749654326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Suppression-OVERTAKE system will give you an unique interaction experience.(Similar to Sekiro's offset, but it's focused on attack instead of defense)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Except super cool actions, this game also has a Diablo-like role development &amp; loot system.  Allocate your attributes, talents FREELY and BUILD your own battle style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Higher the difficulty, better the drops! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer your enemy\u00a0and  LOOT your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If you find bugs or have any suggestion, feel free to contact me. You can send an email or leave me a message on bilibili.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Good Luck &amp; Have Fun!</h2>","developers":["ShiningCloud Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686170/e1796e0e8113ecf60c9370ec27eb91832102314b/header.jpg?t=1749654326","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025@Copyright \u4e91\u7115\u5fa1\u98ce all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153064,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153064/movie480.mp4?t=1749580526","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153064/movie_max.mp4?t=1749580526"},"name":"pv1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153064/b03376163e73b5db42818d51f9817c0753e913ca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749580526","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153064/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749580526","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153064/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749580526"}}],"name":"Monkey King Simulator Special Edition","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">